  "ingredients": [
    "1 quart fresh strawberries, hulled",
    "1 (9 inch) pie crust, baked",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "3 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "0.75 cup water",
    "0.5 cup heavy whipping cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cslFFUktA2HZ9Za37vAm7cqKpnM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-ingredients-5940-4e51e51b0ef942069f121f038889f671.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15836/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange 1/2 of strawberries in baked pastry shell. Place remaining strawberries in a medium saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YMMVnXBJUVydS2h_ZV98WNb4U_M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-5948-ca3ef083d3ab40bb8acebaf395b1f5a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15836/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sugar to the strawberries in the saucepan; place over medium heat and bring to a boil, stirring frequently.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HZa5_k_4NmM-GZstNNfP7i7pzQQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-5953-1706f3f5c1024db799d9804aa6a83dd2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15836/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk cornstarch and water together in a small bowl. Gradually stir cornstarch mixture into boiling strawberry mixture. Reduce heat and simmer mixture until thickened, about 10 minutes, stirring constantly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CIgNcyBrqExQvNPupgIdnowIbsU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-5973-8a4ba082bff34a10a3ac4adab6ad4f10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15836/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cooked strawberry mixture over berries in pastry shell. Refrigerate until chilled and set, at least 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QIoRFzdW3ybtF6Qf4Vqox3QvAyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-6195-a9184cef153549a0af20aa67b9bbbec5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15836/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before serving, whip cream in a medium bowl until soft peaks form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/89uQzTRiW2Mk6_05wHlDj-O7-RI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-step-06-6197-cba3c9f855aa48a096bcb00dde0cc776.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15836/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve each slice of pie with a dollop of whipped cream. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gzwFHz3plZ3KZjJLB7nXVgnf5ZA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15836-strawberry-pie-ii-DDMFS-4x3-6294-020f1ed200db4bf1a221852e92dbb8b4.jpg"
